{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Connect with the coach to book events, ask questions, or try a short guided exercise right from your browser.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbfbfa; --card:#ffffff; --muted:#6b6b6b; --accent:#6aa84f; --accent-2:#2b6cb0; --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      --radius:12px; --maxw:1100px; --gap:24px;
      color-scheme: light;
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#f3f7f5);color:#0f1720;line-height:1.45}
    header{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.6),rgba(250,250,250,0.6));backdrop-filter: blur(6px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(15,23,32,0.04);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:40}
    .nav-inner{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .brand .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin-left:18px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    .container{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:36px auto;padding:0 18px}

    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;align-items:center;}
    @media(min-width:840px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr 380px}}
    .hero .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:28px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(20,30,40,0.06)}
    .hero h1{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:clamp(20px,3vw,28px)}
    .hero p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    .panel{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:20px}
    @media(min-width:920px){.panel{grid-template-columns:1fr 320px}}
    form .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,32,0.07);background:transparent}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px;border:0;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,32,0.06);color:var(--muted)}

    .side-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--glass),rgba(255,255,255,0.85));padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(11,20,40,0.03)}
    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    footer{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:40px auto 80px;padding:0 18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* subtle repeating pattern using SVG file */
    .pattern-hero{background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat;background-size:220px 220px;border-radius:var(--radius)}

    /* gallery */
    .gallery{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .chip{flex:1 1 calc(33% - 12px);min-width:110px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfff7);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,32,0.03)}

    /* reveal animation */
    .reveal-on-scroll{opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px);transition:opacity 520ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.25,1),transform 520ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.25,1)}
    .reveal-on-scroll.is-visible{opacity:1;transform:none}

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
      .reveal-on-scroll{transition:none;opacity:1;transform:none}
    }

    /* modal */
    .modal{position:fixed;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:linear-gradient(rgba(6,12,16,0.35),rgba(6,12,16,0.45));z-index:80;backdrop-filter: blur(4px)}
    .modal-card{width:min(780px,96%);background:var(--card);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(10,20,30,0.25)}
    .modal-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px}
    .modal-body{display:grid;gap:12px}
    .modal-controls{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .circle{width:140px;height:140px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, #fff, #eef7ea);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:12px auto}
    .pulse{width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}

    .sr-only{position:absolute;left:-10000px;top:auto;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}

  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo" aria-hidden>WC</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="about.html">Meet</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="programs.html">Calendar</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
        <a href="testimonials.html">Voices</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html" style="font-weight:800;color:var(--accent-2)">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="hero reveal-on-scroll" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
      <div class="card pattern-hero">
        <h1 id="contact-heading">Reach out, schedule, or try a short practice</h1>
        <p class="lead">I run a series of small-group events focused on dependable habits and useful frameworks. Use the form to describe your needs or tap "Try it now" to run a guided micro-practice in your browser—no sign-up required.</p>
        <div style="margin-top:14px;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <button class="btn" id="primary-cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="book.html">See availability</a>
          <button class="btn ghost" id="try-now">Try it now</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="side-card">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
          <div>
            <div class="meta">Phone</div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">{{PHONE}}</div>
          </div>
          <div style="text-align:right">
            <div class="meta">Email</div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">{{EMAIL}}</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr style="margin:12px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(11,20,40,0.04)">
        <div class="meta">Location</div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        <div style="margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Events run as a series. If you're reaching out about a group, note preferred days or times in the form below.</div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" style="margin-top:28px">
      <form class="card reveal-on-scroll" id="contact-form" aria-labelledby="form-title">
        <h3 id="form-title">Send a quick note</h3>
        <div class="field"><label for="name">Your name</label><input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="First & last"></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="email">Email</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com"></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="interest">I'm interested in</label>
          <select id="interest" name="interest">
            <option>Public workshop series</option>
            <option>Custom team session</option>
            <option>Private coaching package</option>
            <option>General question</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="field"><label for="message">Tell me about your ask</label><textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Dates, group size, goals, or anything else"></textarea></div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px">
          <button type="submit" class="btn">Send message</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn ghost" id="request-call">Request a call</button>
          <div style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Or <a href="book.html">book directly</a></div>
        </div>
      </form>

      <aside class="side-card reveal-on-scroll">
        <h4 style="margin-top:0">What to expect</h4>
        <p class="meta">Short confirmation follow-up. If you're booking an event series you'll get available dates and an outline of outcomes and daily habits the series builds.</p>
        <div style="margin-top:10px">
          <div class="gallery">
            <div class="chip">Small cohorts: consistent peer practice</div>
            <div class="chip">Simple frameworks you can use daily</div>
            <div class="chip">Practical attachments: planners & prompts</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:28px" class="reveal-on-scroll">
      <div class="card">
        <h4 style="margin-top:0">Common questions</h4>
        <div style="display:grid;gap:10px">
          <div>
            <strong>Is this therapy or medical care?</strong>
            <div class="meta">No. The guidance centers on habits, planning frameworks and practical exercises. Not a substitute for medical advice.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>How long are events?</strong>
            <div class="meta">Series sessions are typically 60–75 minutes with brief daily micro-practices you can do on your own.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Can I try a short practice now?</strong>
            <div class="meta">Yes — use the "Try it now" button to open a guided micro-practice (breathing, journaling, intention setting) that runs in your browser.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:0 18px">
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div class="meta">Events series & guided practices — outcomes through steady routines. Contact: {{EMAIL}}</div>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align:right;color:var(--muted)">© <span id="year"></span> All rights reserved</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <!-- Modal template -->
  <div id="exercise-modal" class="modal" hidden aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modal-title">
      <div class="modal-head">
        <div>
          <h3 id="modal-title">Try a micro-practice</h3>
          <div class="meta">Choose breathing, journaling, or set a short intention.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
          <button id="close-modal" class="btn ghost">Close</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div class="modal-controls">
          <button class="btn" data-mode="breath">Breathing</button>
          <button class="btn ghost" data-mode="journal">Journaling</button>
          <button class="btn ghost" data-mode="intention">Intention</button>
        </div>

        <div id="mode-area" style="padding-top:8px">
          <!-- dynamic content inserted here -->
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Basic interactions
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
    // primary CTA navigation
    document.getElementById('primary-cta').addEventListener('click',function(){
      window.location.href = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}';
    });

    // Reveal on scroll with prefers-reduced-motion support
    (function(){
      var reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      var items = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-on-scroll');
      if(reduce){ // show all
        items.forEach(function(i){i.classList.add('is-visible');});
        return;
      }
      var io = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){
        entries.forEach(function(e){
          if(e.isIntersecting){
            e.target.classList.add('is-visible');
            io.unobserve(e.target);
          }
        });
      },{threshold:0.12});
      items.forEach(function(i){io.observe(i)});
    })();

    // Modal & guided micro-practice
    var modal = document.getElementById('exercise-modal');
    var modeArea = document.getElementById('mode-area');
    var activeMode = null;

    function openModal(){ modal.hidden = false; modal.removeAttribute('aria-hidden'); document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden'; }
    function closeModal(){ modal.hidden = true; modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true'); document.body.style.overflow=''; stopPractice(); }

    document.getElementById('try-now').addEventListener('click',openModal);
    document.getElementById('close-modal').addEventListener('click',closeModal);
    modal.addEventListener('click',function(e){ if(e.target===modal) closeModal(); });

    // Mode selection
    document.querySelectorAll('.modal-controls button').forEach(function(btn){
      btn.addEventListener('click',function(){
        document.querySelectorAll('.modal-controls button').forEach(b=>b.classList.add('ghost'));
        btn.classList.remove('ghost');
        startMode(btn.dataset.mode);
      });
    });

    // stop any running timers/intervals
    var _int = null; var _timeout = null;
    function stopPractice(){ if(_int) clearInterval(_int); if(_timeout) clearTimeout(_timeout); _int = null; _timeout = null; modeArea.innerHTML=''; activeMode=null; }

    function startMode(mode){ stopPractice(); activeMode = mode; if(mode==='breath') renderBreathing(); if(mode==='journal') renderJournal(); if(mode==='intention') renderIntention(); }

    // BREATHING: visual expanding circle + simple inhale/exhale timing
    function renderBreathing(){
      modeArea.innerHTML = '';
      var desc = document.createElement('div'); desc.className='meta'; desc.textContent='Follow the circle. 4s inhale, 6s exhale. 3 rounds.';
      var circleWrap = document.createElement('div'); circleWrap.style.textAlign='center';
      var circle = document.createElement('div'); circle.className='circle';
      var pulse = document.createElement('div'); pulse.className='pulse'; pulse.textContent='Ready';
      circle.appendChild(pulse); circleWrap.appendChild(circle);
      var controls = document.createElement('div'); controls.style.display='flex'; controls.style.justifyContent='center'; controls.style.gap='8px'; controls.style.marginTop='6px';
      var start = document.createElement('button'); start.className='btn'; start.textContent='Start';
      var stop = document.createElement('button'); stop.className='btn ghost'; stop.textContent='Stop';
      controls.appendChild(start); controls.appendChild(stop);
      modeArea.appendChild(desc); modeArea.appendChild(circleWrap); modeArea.appendChild(controls);

      var rounds = 3; var current = 0; var phase = 'idle'; var step = 0;
      function animateBreath(){
        if(current>=rounds) { pulse.textContent='Done'; pulse.style.transform='scale(1)'; return; }
        // inhale 4s -> expand
        pulse.textContent='Inhale'; pulse.style.transition='transform 4s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.25,1)'; pulse.style.transform='scale(1.6)';
        _timeout = setTimeout(function(){
          // hold transition tiny
          pulse.textContent='Exhale'; pulse.style.transition='transform 6s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.25,1)'; pulse.style.transform='scale(0.8)';
          _timeout = setTimeout(function(){ current++; animateBreath(); }, 6000);
        },4000);
      }
      start.addEventListener('click',function(){ if(_int||_timeout) return; current=0; animateBreath(); });
      stop.addEventListener('click',stopPractice);
    }

    // JOURNALING: timer with prompt and editable area (local only)
    function renderJournal(){
      modeArea.innerHTML='';
      var promptList = [
        'Name one small thing you can do tomorrow to make the day clearer.',
        'Describe a moment this week that felt steady—what helped?',
        'Write for 5 minutes about what you want to practice consistently.'
      ];
      var prompt = promptList[Math.floor(Math.random()*promptList.length)];
      var p = document.createElement('div'); p.className='meta'; p.textContent=prompt;
      var ta = document.createElement('textarea'); ta.placeholder='Write freely...'; ta.style.width='100%'; ta.style.minHeight='160px'; ta.style.marginTop='8px';
      var ctr = document.createElement('div'); ctr.style.display='flex'; ctr.style.alignItems='center'; ctr.style.gap='8px'; ctr.style.marginTop='8px';
      var start = document.createElement('button'); start.className='btn'; start.textContent='Start 5-min timer';
      var save = document.createElement('button'); save.className='btn ghost'; save.textContent='Download note';
      var timer = document.createElement('div'); timer.className='meta'; timer.textContent='Ready';
      ctr.appendChild(start); ctr.appendChild(save); ctr.appendChild(timer);
      modeArea.appendChild(p); modeArea.appendChild(ta); modeArea.appendChild(ctr);

      start.addEventListener('click',function(){ if(_int) return; var remaining = 300; timer.textContent = formatTime(remaining); _int = setInterval(function(){ remaining--; timer.textContent=formatTime(remaining); if(remaining<=0){ clearInterval(_int); _int=null; timer.textContent='Finished'; } },1000); });
      save.addEventListener('click',function(){ var blob = new Blob([ta.value],{type:'text/plain'}); var url = URL.createObjectURL(blob); var a = document.createElement('a'); a.href=url; a.download='journal.txt'; document.body.appendChild(a); a.click(); a.remove(); URL.revokeObjectURL(url); });
    }

    function formatTime(s){ var m = Math.floor(s/60); var r = s%60; return m+':' + (r<10? '0'+r : r); }

    // INTENTION: short guided set + quick habit link
    function renderIntention(){
      modeArea.innerHTML='';
      var h = document.createElement('div'); h.className='meta'; h.textContent='Choose a concise intention and one tiny habit to anchor it.';
      var input = document.createElement('input'); input.type='text'; input.placeholder='My intention (e.g., move mindfully each morning)'; input.style.width='100%'; input.style.marginTop='8px'; input.style.padding='10px'; input.style.borderRadius='8px';
      var habit = document.createElement('input'); habit.type='text'; habit.placeholder='A tiny habit to support it (e.g., 1-minute stretch)'; habit.style.width='100%'; habit.style.marginTop='8px'; habit.style.padding='10px'; habit.style.borderRadius='8px';
      var save = document.createElement('button'); save.className='btn'; save.textContent='Lock intention';
      var result = document.createElement('div'); result.style.marginTop='8px'; result.className='meta';
      modeArea.appendChild(h); modeArea.appendChild(input); modeArea.appendChild(habit); modeArea.appendChild(save); modeArea.appendChild(result);

      save.addEventListener('click',function(){ if(!input.value.trim()){ result.textContent='Please write an intention.'; return } var text='Intention: '+input.value.trim()+" — Habit: "+habit.value.trim(); result.textContent='Saved (localOnly): '+text; // keep it simple
      });
    }

    // safety: close modal on ESC
    window.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){ if(e.key==='Escape' && !modal.hidden) closeModal(); });

    // send form: demonstration only (no network)
    document.getElementById('contact-form').addEventListener('submit',function(e){ e.preventDefault(); var name=document.getElementById('name').value||'Someone'; alert('Thanks, '+name+' — your message is noted.'); this.reset(); });

  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Contact Page (chunk 4)

This bundle contains the contact page and usage notes for the wellness coach site.

Files included:
- contact.html — the contact page with an embedded guided micro-practice modal and scroll-reveal behaviors.

Placeholders present in the HTML (replace in your build):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Highlights and features:
- Guided exercise modal (Try it now) with three modes implemented in plain JavaScript:
  - Breathing: visual expanding/contracting circle with inhale/exhale timing (4s inhale / 6s exhale, 3 rounds by default).
  - Journaling: randomized short prompt, editable text area, 5-minute timer and option to download entry as a text file.
  - Intention: quick form to lock an intention and an anchor habit (stored only for the current session).
- Modal runs entirely locally — no external assets, no back-end calls.
- Scroll-triggered reveal: elements with the .reveal-on-scroll class are observed with IntersectionObserver and get the .is-visible class when in view.
  - Respects prefers-reduced-motion: when reduced motion is enabled, reveals are instantaneous and animations are disabled.
- Nav uses a customized label set and maps correctly to the project pages:
  - Home → index.html
  - Meet → about.html
  - Offerings → services.html
  - Calendar → programs.html
  - Rates → pricing.html
  - Voices → testimonials.html
  - Reserve → book.html
  - Connect → contact.html

Notes for integration:
- The page references an SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg for a repeating background. Include the unique SVG in the assets folder when assembling the full site.
- The contact form is demo-only and triggers an alert on submit. Wire it to your server or form service as needed.
- All interactions are implemented without external libraries.

Accessibility & behavior:
- Modal is dismissible via the Close button, clicking outside, or pressing Escape.
- prefers-reduced-motion is honored for the reveal animations.
- Keyboard focus management is simple; if you need stricter focus trapping in the modal, add focus-trap logic when integrating.

Design notes for maintainers:
- Color and radius variables are declared in :root for easy adjustments.
- Animation durations, number of rounds, and journaling timer are defined inline in the script and are easy to tweak.

If you need the matching assets (pattern.svg) or additional pages for this site, request the next chunk(s) and include the seed and layoutFamily for consistency."}
